# Quality gates that must pass before a commit lands. These are the three
# checks that already existed in the project but were only ever run by hand;
# the hook makes them non-optional so type errors and i18n drift can no longer
# accumulate silently (see commit 8f95711, which had to clear 87 at once).
#
# Monorepo note: the app lives in apps/mobile, so the checks run from there.
cd apps/mobile

# 1. Lint only the staged .ts/.tsx files (fast). lint-staged reads its config
#    from apps/mobile/package.json and only sees files staged under this dir.
pnpm exec lint-staged

# 2. Project-wide type check. Regenerates the typed-routes contract first so
#    navigation is checked against the real route list even without a running
#    dev server — this is what turns "the link works sometimes" into a compile
#    error at commit time.
pnpm run typecheck

# 3. Translation drift guard across the 7 locales.
pnpm run i18n:check
